  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "Given Equation:\n\n219 + 512 × 8 ÷ 18 - 3 = 1368\n\nBODMAS Rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/943d21356d52652b76aa163fb3cde072387473743a3932301cda4e5eaaacfbbf.png] \n\n1) - and +\n\nLHS = 219 - 512 x 8 ÷ 18 + 3\n\n⇒ 219 - 512 x 0.44 + 3\n\n⇒ 219 - 225.28 + 3\n\n⇒ 228.28 - 219\n\n⇒ -3.28 ≠ 1368 (L.H.S ≠ R.H.S)\n\n**2) ÷ and ​x**\n\n**LHS = 219 + 512 ÷ 8 x 18 - 3**\n\n**⇒ 219 + 64 x 18 - 3**\n\n**⇒ 219 + 1152 - 3**\n\n**⇒ 1371 - 3**\n\n**⇒ 1368 = 1368 (L.H.S = R.H.S)**\n\n3)** **× and +\n\nLHS = 219 x 512 + 8 ÷ 18 - 3\n\n⇒ 219 x 512 + 0.44 - 3\n\n⇒ 112128 + 0.44 - 3\n\n⇒ 112128.44 - 3\n\n⇒ 112125.44 ≠ 1368 (L.H.S ≠ R.H.S)\n\n4) + and ÷\n\nLHS = 219 ÷ 512 x 8 + 18 - 3\n\n⇒ 0.427 x 8 + 18 - 3\n\n⇒ 3.416 + 18 - 3\n\n⇒ 21.416 - 3\n\n⇒ 18.416 ≠ 1368 (L.H.S ≠ R.H.S)\n\nHence, “÷ and ​×” is the correct answer. \n11",
